{title: The Potters Hand}
{key: G}

{comment: Intro}
[G]     [D/Gb]        [F]     [Dsus4]         [D]
{ci: (repeat)}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Beautiful Lord, [D/Gb]Wonderful Saviour
[C]I know for sure, [Cm]all of my days are [Em]held in your hands, [Asus4]crafted in[A]to your [Am7]perfect [D]plan

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]You gently call me [D/Gb]into your presence, [C]guiding me by [Cm]Your Holy Spirit
[Em]Teach me dear Lord to live [Asus4]all of my [A]life [Am7]through Your [D]eyes

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[Em]I'm captured by Your [D/Gb]holy calling
[G]Set me apart, I [C]know you're draw[D]ing  [Em]me to yourself
